What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/*/frequency
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Current DDR frequency in Hz, queried from Samsung J320FN PM
                firmware. Reading issues a serialized firmware request.

What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/*/target_frequency
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Firmware's stored DDR target in Hz. This target can change
                independently of the current rate or application processor.

What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/*/high_rate_lock
Date:           October 2026
Description:
                Write-only boolean application processor vote. True requests
                a 640 MHz lock; false releases the lock to the firmware's
                stored target and permits autonomous modem-driven changes.
                False does not select 192 MHz. Firmware owns clock changes
                and coordinator side effects. A failed command can already
                have changed the vote; subsequent requests fail until a
                qualified fresh boot. No previous vote restoration is implied.
